

sudo cp ./certs/keycloak.crt \
  /usr/local/share/ca-certificates/keycloak.crt
sudo update-ca-certificates
curl -v https://localhost:8443
curl -vk https://localhost:8443

4. Firefox
If curl works without -k but Firefox still shows a warning:
1. Open about:preferences#privacy.
2. Go to Certificates.
3. Click View Certificates.
4. Select Authorities.
5. Import certs/keycloak.crt.
6. Enable Trust this CA to identify websites.
7. Restart Firefox.